diagram cloud "Shop on AWS"

Users [icon: users]

AWS [icon: aws-cloud] {
  Gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway]
  VPC [icon: aws-vpc] {
    Orders API [icon: aws-lambda]
    Data {
      Orders table [icon: aws-dynamodb, table: shop.orders]
    }
  }
  Receipts [icon: aws-s3]
}

Users > Gateway > Orders API: HTTPS
Orders API <> Orders table
Orders API - Receipts: PUT
Orders API ..> Users: assumes a signed-in user
